{"obsah":"<p>Vlasta rode an exhibition for the cycling and leisure shop Harfa Sport in cooperation with Levelsportkoncept (our team partner). Thanks to that he got to try out a loaned Superior bike, which he then used to ride down and up the stairs in the shop, as well as for a bit of hopping on the obstacles, to show that XC bikes from Superior can take something too. Since time for practice on the bike was limited and he hadn't ridden it in, for the jumps over volunteers he reached for his Trial bike. Among the guests, Olympian Ondřej Synek lay down under Vlasta. Visitors could see the new collections of clothing, accessories and bikes for the coming bike season.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F04%2FDSC01807.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F04%2FDSC01807.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250547\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F04%2FDSC01826-Enhanced-NR.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F04%2FDSC01826-Enhanced-NR.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250546\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F04%2FDSC01840-Enhanced-NR.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F04%2FDSC01840-Enhanced-NR.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250550\"/>